{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-branching-qvalue-factorization","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:branching-qvalue-factorization","kind":"proposition","title":"Exact factorization of the branching Q-value","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-spectator-normalization"],"tags":["factorization","q-value","character-sum","exact","branching"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.branching_qvalue_factorization","text":"branching-qvalue-factorization.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"prop:branching-qvalue-factorization\"></a>\n<strong>Proposition.</strong> <em>Exact factorization of the branching Q-value</em></p>\n<p>We compute the branching <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{Q}_q</code>-value by summing over all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4^A</code> channel configurations.</p>\n<h2>Statement</h2>\n<p><strong>Proposition.</strong>\n<em>For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta^-</code> decay of a nucleus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(Z, N)</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A = Z + N</code>:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\sum_{\\text{all } 4^A \\text{ configs}}\n  \\Delta m_e\n  = a^Z \\cdot b^{N-1} \\cdot (a - b)</code></pre>\n<p><em>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b</code> are the per-nucleon channel sums.</em></p>\n"}
